{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_intro_1000_102mis", "source_sha256": "2a2099e3ed70288007d4173f969d0ce7d0b92b22246d76ed4bf36dfc180770c3", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}さんっ！\nミシンですよ、ミシンっ！", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生！\n是缝纫机喔，缝纫机！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_intro_1001_p", "source_sha256": "a9d848322ce8304f3169196e1cf5a436a8225641e8047e0bd90b1c680be85318", "ja": "は……？　ミ、ミシン？", "zh": "什么……？缝、缝纫机？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_intro_1002_102mis", "source_sha256": "3d1ac0e2e13640f87dceb664ae4f35c5612a89e16f431a75edbdcefc8bec04d1", "ja": "はい！　経費で買ってもらっちゃったんです！\n最新型のコンピューターミシン！", "zh": "是的！这是用公司经费申请到的！\n是最新型的电脑型缝纫机！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_intro_1003_102mis", "source_sha256": "b66de9fa6f2da8ea0d6a5c1952b269d303d902c1b0aee41d73702313cd9866e4", "ja": "これで、かわいい衣装もかっこいい衣装も、\nばりばり作っちゃいますから！　期待しててください！", "zh": "我会用这台缝纫机做出许多可爱\n和帅气的服装！敬请期待喔～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_intro_1004_p", "source_sha256": "27c2bd87db2f70a620ec62ff1f75626b30c539efed7618a1bb413d455135f469", "ja": "へえ……。社長、奮発しましたね。\nその事を伝えるために、わざわざ？", "zh": "哦……社长这次很大手笔呢。\n你特地来找我就是为了这件事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_intro_1005_102mis", "source_sha256": "d38be62ffd3494efcd01611d4c5d562d11f58523dfb2773899b3ba6e87eb5358", "ja": "えっ？　えーっと……ごめんなさい！\n社長さんが呼んでますよって、伝えに来たんでした！", "zh": "咦？呃……对不起！\n我是来转告你，社长有事找你的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_intro_1006_102mis", "source_sha256": "b042a265b84de4ac32aa6d2a310153c8cb4354cdad36b4060ae08d5e165021c5", "ja": "私ってば、ミシンのことで頭がいっぱいで……。\nああっ、恥ずかしい～。", "zh": "我也真是的，满脑子都在想缝纫机……\n啊啊～好丢脸喔～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_intro_1007_p", "source_sha256": "c225a6c143e587c5792b7f89d75a978ef155cdff9ef375105e467851927bec7e", "ja": "いやいや、いいじゃないですか。青羽さんの\n衣装への情熱は、本当にすごいと思いますよ。", "zh": "不会不会，这没什么不好呀。\n我真的很佩服青羽小姐对服装的热情喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_intro_1008_p", "source_sha256": "d00db132d300b6e884cd1bfd54d7af5fb54427987e1e2db0affe3f5bedfe64c6", "ja": "それじゃ、社長のところに行って来ます！", "zh": "那我就去找社长了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_intro_1009_102mis", "source_sha256": "fbda287e5ab91495f2612fcee2fddb3ecdac91a2f8b3848fd631b6e168cdbc5c", "ja": "は～い！　いってらっしゃい！", "zh": "好的～！请慢走！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_intro_1010_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_intro_1011_p", "source_sha256": "386ad7d4b1f277e63da3c285b1d0b65b9a5e1b51609d391ff58cbf8ce6a01fab", "ja": "社長、お待たせしました。\n用件というのは……？", "zh": "社长，久等了。\n有什么事吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_intro_1012_president", "source_sha256": "562983cf845934af2c75b294fe7cbef5dfd2b28f8a75b187e43cc54abfa7c1ab", "ja": "うむ、よく来てくれたね。実は、君も楽しみにしていた\nあのオーディションの、結果が届いたのだよ……！", "zh": "嗯，你来啦。是这样的，\n你也很期待的那场试镜结果已经送来了……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_intro_1013_p", "source_sha256": "ee04be117b5a3835df0884f6115f90b89551ac3b96654a0b53202119044deeee", "ja": "あのオーディション……？　もしかして、\n『階（きざはし）のスターエレメンツ』ですか！？", "zh": "那场试镜……？\n该不会是《阶梯上的Star Elements》吧！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_intro_1014_101kot", "source_sha256": "7fc807de4869f90274ac6187b9a2d184094902efcffef32b146a228cc0b1269e", "ja": "『階のスターエレメンツ』……？\nそれって、何かのタイトルですか？", "zh": "《阶梯上的Star Elements》……？\n是哪部作品的名称吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_intro_1015_p", "source_sha256": "a8b1ef19c7c4093e190e768d89c88e1f1c3e3b21bc370092ed6fe9a2ee70f1e7", "ja": "あ、音無さん、お疲れさまです！\n『階のスターエレメンツ』は企画中のドラマなんです。", "zh": "啊，音无小姐，辛苦了！\n《阶梯上的Star Elements》是还在企划中的电视剧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_intro_1016_p", "source_sha256": "c13ff7c8a363ca35855ed79b7b774af12982f93d68fce3133b7cfc49b5d697ff", "ja": "たったひとつのデビュー枠を賭けて\n激しく火花を散らす、3人のアイドル候補生……。", "zh": "三位偶像候补生为竞争唯一的出道名额，\n擦出激战的火花……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_intro_1017_p", "source_sha256": "30dfd0223dadb4cde394ed4c918f0cfa2060989ad5ca2d4abaecb81209e1555e", "ja": "そんな、夢に向かって突き進む少女達の、\nひたむきな姿を描いたお話なんですよ。", "zh": "故事中刻划着少女们朝梦想勇往直前、\n一心一意努力的模样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_intro_1018_101kot", "source_sha256": "ccbd594afff0f3a6f38211a249a1013b1c202874028ab1e4d5ed72e277edfa57", "ja": "へえ～っ。なんだか、面白そうですね！\n劇場とも似てるかも……。", "zh": "喔～听起来很有趣呢！\n或许跟我们的剧场很相似……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_intro_1019_101kot", "source_sha256": "dd080e057916374eb266545d01f4aa3e750b23c6912cf0e6baf6d36bd574c130", "ja": "それで、オーディションの結果はどうだったんですか？\n社長、焦らさないで教えてください！", "zh": "所以试镜的结果怎么样了？\n社长，别卖关子了，快告诉我们吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_intro_1020_president", "source_sha256": "8fe90969b0f8141c1223e50cbb8b39e1d6747c0fb7b9c5decb859c6bc054295f", "ja": "いや、それは音無君がさえぎったからで……まあいい。\nそれでは、発表しよう。……うぉっほん！", "zh": "不，那是因为音无你打断我……\n算了，那我就来发表结果吧……咳咳！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_intro_1021_president", "source_sha256": "3f157423a37f090e1c757fe0decd1138cba5d8030598cd032077576d88da0312", "ja": "主役となる3人のアイドル候補生役として、\n我が765プロのアイドル達……。", "zh": "要饰演故事主角──三位偶像候补生的，\n已经决定是我们765艺能的偶像……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_intro_1022_president", "source_sha256": "31ebb9e61a1977b5a051eba037103cbd120ff5e422b64c5d483ecb28e5ee65dd", "ja": "春日未来君、矢吹可奈君、田中琴葉君、\n3人の出演が決定したよ！　おめでとう！", "zh": "春日未来、矢吹可奈、田中琴叶这三位啰！\n恭喜！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_intro_1023_p", "source_sha256": "d858626ac3970d92a7eb8106ff71b1403aade702b33027493e7a22e133884980", "ja": "全員、合格ですか！？\nそれも、主演のアイドル役で……！", "zh": "她们三个都录取了吗！？\n而且还担纲主角，演出偶像角色……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_intro_1024_101kot", "source_sha256": "e6b113afb566cd92e8d4f8988c7164b56386c97bf5f8ae21b920de5b92a0d7d9", "ja": "おお～っ！　おめでとうございます、\n{$P$}さん！", "zh": "喔喔～！\n恭喜你，{$P$}先生！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_intro_1025_president", "source_sha256": "e5949e93610474e33f80448e4a98ca67788e47971b2d2e14cf75ef84ccb18e4d", "ja": "3人にはユニットを組んで、ドラマの主題歌も\n担当してもらうことになっている……。", "zh": "她们三位将要组成团体，\n也会负责演唱电视剧的主题曲……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_intro_1026_president", "source_sha256": "cfd0e9c2a1d56cf1b21ce96992e3ebfaecf97592d1874fddae7f7d4f55e98170", "ja": "君には、ぜひともこの企画を成功に導いてほしい！\nよろしく頼んだよ！", "zh": "希望你能引导这次企划迈向成功！\n一切就交给你啰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_intro_1027", "source_sha256": "59c55d4b878df63d50ff372587f8319ae3821c1cf3fe8c6bce31cf184b4a7c34", "ja": "わかりました！", "zh": "我知道了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_intro_2000_p", "source_sha256": "d7ef9e8aaf167e0a7a3a89d210fa25f36094830062f028a51cc9a3b463cfe956", "ja": "わかりました！\n必ず、成功させてみせます！", "zh": "我知道了！\n我一定会让企划成功的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_intro_2001_president", "source_sha256": "b7d14d35f4b5b789e5fefa791446d5f5b0c995134030f193ed444e7e789ae8e3", "ja": "うむ！　いい返事だ。", "zh": "嗯！答得好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_intro_2002_president", "source_sha256": "875fcc2d45983b25c0d0b3db643c74c285ac33dde05a281052c33689e72dce35", "ja": "夢を目指して、互いに競い合う少女達……。\nそれは劇場のアイドル達、そのものともいえる。", "zh": "迈向梦想、互相较劲的少女们……\n这句形容也能套用在剧场的各个偶像身上。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_intro_2003_president", "source_sha256": "ff3cf5f32e1ba4445f61dea7213fef7f41bce7a322f7a5248020bae702b56dfa", "ja": "彼女達の熱量が視聴者にも伝わるよう、\n頑張ってくれたまえ！", "zh": "你就好好努力，\n协助她们将热情传达给观众吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_intro_2004_101kot", "source_sha256": "db28950934c2df6c12637107d7d157e239d5824cb2c866cd9d77778eaff42b2e", "ja": "アイドルのみんなが、アイドルの役を演じたら\nどうなるんでしょう？　楽しみですね！", "zh": "由偶像们来饰演偶像角色，会有什么样的成果呢？\n真令人期待！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_intro_2005_p", "source_sha256": "03ea7375c83f7160667ea52d2333f4ecda5e034bf929a46cca4906197f25ffb8", "ja": "（社長の言う通り、劇場のみんなは\nいつもひたむきに頑張っている）", "zh": "（就像社长说的一样，\n剧场的大家总是一心一意努力向前。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_intro_2006_p", "source_sha256": "13dc601c2da768e2ce1ee9cac8ce2ac28580ff4a86e375dfd377657574b0a0bd", "ja": "（そんなみんなの魅力をダイレクトに表現できれば、\nきっといいドラマになるはずだ……！）", "zh": "（若能将大家努力时的魅力如实展现出来，\n一定能拍出一部精采的电视剧……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
